# المرحلة الثالثة عشرة — اختبارات النموذج المنتجـي

أضف اختبارات تمنع عودة فهم SaaS الخاطئ:

```text
Partner is not a tenant.
Store is not a tenant.
Customer is not a tenant.
Captain is not a tenant.
Field actor is not a tenant.

Partner scope cannot access another partner.
Partner captain cannot receive another partner's order.
BThwani captain cannot be assigned as partner captain without affiliation.
Operator permissions are explicit and do not come from tenant ownership.
```

اختبر أوضاع التنفيذ:

```text
BTHWANI_DELIVERY
PARTNER_DELIVERY
CUSTOMER_PICKUP
```

واختبر الفصل المالي:

```text
DSH determines operational completion.
WLT determines financial consequences.
DSH cannot alter wallet balance.
DSH cannot insert ledger entries.
Partner COD creates partner debt/receivable according to commercial agreement.
Monthly subscription does not silently create per-order commission.
Order commission does not silently create monthly subscription.
```

